  "global_rules_applied": [
    "所有权边界：Text→XYUI-1；Input/Action/Search→XYUI-2；Navigation/Pagination/Switching→XYUI-3；Hover/Selected/Focus/Feedback→XYUI-4；Layout/Scroll/Virtualization/Container→XYUI-5；Data & Collection Semantics→XYUI-6",
    "组合优先级：REF → REUSE → COMPOSE → COMPONENT_SPECIFIC → GAP；不创建第二真值",
    "State（AMEND-A）= XY.State.ComposeMode（Single Primary Owner per Visual Channel）；XYUI-6 不建第二套 State Priority",
    "Typography = XY.Font.UI + XY.FontSize.* / XY.FontWeight.*；Primary = XY.Text.Primary；TruncatedText / Tooltip REF XYUI-1",
    "Alignment = XY.Alignment.Text / Number 消费（文字左、数值右、Boolean/Icon 居中）",
    "Density = XY.Density.*（Auto|Compact|Comfortable）；行高/密度档位 = COMPONENT_SPECIFIC；Compact≠拥挤",
    "分隔 = XY.Divider.ListRow / Header / VerticalSplit；默认全网格深色框线 Forbidden；Zebra = Surface 交替低对比",
    "Scroll = XYUI-5 ScrollArea（XY.Scrollbar.* 视觉）；Virtualization 机制 = XYUI-5 5.14；数据层合同 = 6.20",
    "Selection/Focus/HitTarget = XYUI-4 + XY.HitTarget.ListRow/TreeRow；Input = XYUI-2；Pagination = XYUI-3；ViewSwitcher = XYUI-3",
    "效率三原则：第一眼看到关键信息 / 高频操作一层直达 / 一次点击不两次（危险不可逆例外：confirmation+undo+guard）",
    "信息优先级 P0~P3 = XYUI-6 集合层机制（P3→P2→P1 隐藏；P0 不得隐藏）",
    "排序表达 = 字段 + 方向语义文字；↑↓ 仅 Secondary Direction Indicator（GAP:XYUI6-GAP-001）",
    "性能合同 = Virtualization / Incremental Update / Stable Identity / Minimal Re-render / Local Update / 禁无谓全量重建",
    "响应式 = same semantics, different presentation/input；移动端 ≠ Desktop Table 缩小版",
    "原稿 16 处 px 叙述尺寸收敛为 DIP 组件档位（COMPONENT_SPECIFIC）；0 hex / 0 rgb / 0 hsl / 0 旧字体"
  ],
